(text "J320 pin 29 is the switched 5 V rail. Pin 2 needs mainboard R387 fitted for the I2C buffer." (at 650.24 709.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid ca77532d-e783-5bbc-a081-5b4b4ecebb75))
(text "U321 A side is switched 5 V; B side is 3.3 V. Its power-off isolation keeps the unpowered LED driver off the EC bus." (at 650.24 720.09 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid a026cfa0-d47f-5de2-80a8-63b56a4adba1))
(text "ADDR1/ADDR2 at VCC select 7-bit address 0x2F. SDB rises through R323/C326; wait 20 ms before setup." (at 650.24 730.25 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid ea016db5-50df-51a5-ab8b-2a347b7bd86f))
(text "R320 limits peak sink current to about 11.3 mA at the datasheet corner: 18 active sinks stay below the cable budget." (at 650.24 740.41 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 9e520806-53e4-575a-802e-9d7c2b3c1ce9))
(text "Keep C322/C323 close to VCC, C324/C325 close to PVCC, and R320 close to ISET. Connect the exposed pad to ground." (at 650.24 750.57 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 3d35e909-1d86-5a9e-8e07-01939a0d7a27))
